1
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:10,900
Jakah!

2
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,280
Let go of Heli.

3
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:15,280
If you want him, come and get him.

4
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:20,830
Jakah!

5
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:27,550
Chris, what are you doing?

6
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:31,350
I came to save you, Sooha.

7
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:34,010
From these vampires.

8
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:38,930
I'm the only one who believed you.

9
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:41,930
So you should trust me, too.

10
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:48,020
Have you forgotten whose 
fault my death was?

11
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:51,280
You're not Chris.

12
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:55,030
Who are you?

13
00:00:58,270 --> 00:01:00,140
Who do you think?

14
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:31,000
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

15
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:36,010
- That's Fate -

16
00:02:50,810 --> 00:02:51,940
Damn...

17
00:02:52,780 --> 00:02:57,360
I'm disappointed by how weak you are.

18
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:01,160
Do you want to meet the same fate again?

19
00:03:18,130 --> 00:03:19,800
Who are you?

20
00:03:22,510 --> 00:03:24,260
Why do you want Sooha?

21
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:28,720
Stay here.

22
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:31,140
Sooha, come here.

23
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:35,400
<i>Is he a vampire?</i>

24
00:03:36,830 --> 00:03:37,910
<i>Be careful.</i>

25
00:04:23,150 --> 00:04:24,150
Sooha!

26
00:04:24,150 --> 00:04:26,510
Sooha, are you okay?

27
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:29,700
Heli, I...

28
00:04:30,020 --> 00:04:33,980
That's not the Chris I know.

29
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:37,710
Chris isn't one of them... 
He's not a vampire!

30
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,950
I'm sorry, Sooha.

31
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,610
This is what I am.

32
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:54,150
You can hate me if you want, 
but can I flee with you for now?

33
00:04:55,890 --> 00:04:58,120
I just want to take you someplace safe.

34
00:04:59,230 --> 00:05:00,150
Heli!

35
00:05:05,540 --> 00:05:06,530
Heli!

36
00:05:09,450 --> 00:05:10,780
Let go!

37
00:05:10,780 --> 00:05:13,450
Why are you going with them?

38
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:18,380
Why don't you understand? 
I'm doing this for you.

39
00:05:38,310 --> 00:05:39,440
Solon!

40
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:52,430
Wolves?

41
00:06:52,430 --> 00:06:53,680
Sooha!

42
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:55,430
Khan?

43
00:07:02,210 --> 00:07:03,310
Solon!

44
00:07:06,850 --> 00:07:09,070
They just keep coming.

45
00:07:09,070 --> 00:07:10,490
Don't!

46
00:07:10,490 --> 00:07:14,580
If you keep getting in my way, 
I'll knock you out if I have to.

47
00:07:15,010 --> 00:07:18,250
He's no ordinary vampire!

48
00:07:18,250 --> 00:07:20,290
Let's hit him with everything we've got!

49
00:07:25,590 --> 00:07:26,630
What?

50
00:07:26,630 --> 00:07:28,460
Come on, while we have the chance.

51
00:07:32,470 --> 00:07:37,150
You really don't know anything, do you?

52
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:44,000
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

53
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:47,980
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

54
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:01,160
Th-Thank you.

55
00:08:01,850 --> 00:08:04,170
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

56
00:08:06,450 --> 00:08:07,550
I'm fine.

57
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:15,630
I'm sorry for lying to you.

58
00:08:17,470 --> 00:08:22,130
We've kept our identities hidden 
ever since we left the orphanage.

59
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,460
We just couldn't tell you.

60
00:08:28,210 --> 00:08:35,290
You hating us scared us way more than 
anyone else finding out we're vampires.

61
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:38,550
I'm sorry, Sooha.

62
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:43,830
Honestly, I'm confused.

63
00:08:44,420 --> 00:08:47,710
I can't believe you're vampires.

64
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:51,010
You grew up at the orphanage 
together, right?

65
00:08:51,380 --> 00:08:53,900
How did you all become vampires?

66
00:08:54,350 --> 00:08:56,930
Were you all bitten as children?

67
00:08:58,450 --> 00:08:59,570
We don't know.

68
00:09:05,900 --> 00:09:10,190
We've been vampires for as 
long as we can remember.

69
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:14,530
It was an orphanage in name only.

70
00:09:14,750 --> 00:09:18,990
We were actually imprisoned 
and kept under close watch.

71
00:09:20,370 --> 00:09:25,100
For a long time, that was our whole world.

72
00:09:27,220 --> 00:09:29,430
We don't know anything for certain.

73
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:34,920
We don't know if we were 
bitten or born this way.

74
00:09:36,470 --> 00:09:42,420
Not only that, but unlike other vampires, 
we're fine with sunlight and crosses.

75
00:09:42,420 --> 00:09:45,980
Then how do you know you're vampires?

76
00:09:47,290 --> 00:09:54,490
I know you have special powers, 
but you could be different, like me.

77
00:09:56,590 --> 00:09:59,450
We get the urge to drink blood.

78
00:10:01,750 --> 00:10:04,310
We instinctively seek it out.

79
00:10:05,370 --> 00:10:09,850
We don't want to eat anything else, 
and we don't die if we don't.

80
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:15,430
But we only drink blood once a year.

81
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:17,960
On our birthday.

82
00:10:19,070 --> 00:10:22,210
We only drink the blood of 
recently deceased animals.

83
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:27,240
We've never hurt a person, 
and we've never drunk human blood.

84
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:29,960
We swore to each other we wouldn't.

85
00:10:32,450 --> 00:10:34,840
It's true. Please believe me.

86
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:40,190
No, you don't have to believe me.

87
00:10:41,730 --> 00:10:45,120
I'll do my best to convince you.

88
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:51,240
Why did you come to save me?

89
00:10:52,100 --> 00:10:54,450
I said those terrible things to you.

90
00:10:55,330 --> 00:10:57,470
I felt like I had to.

91
00:10:58,280 --> 00:11:00,520
Like I had to protect you.

92
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:04,890
Since the moment I first met you...

93
00:11:05,740 --> 00:11:09,620
I've felt like that was my destiny.

94
00:11:11,130 --> 00:11:16,920
Until then, I didn't know who 
I was or how I should live.

95
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:22,220
But for the first time, 
I felt like I'd found the answer.

96
00:11:24,610 --> 00:11:30,580
I was born to protect you, 
and I have to keep protecting you.

97
00:11:40,530 --> 00:11:41,410
Heli...

98
00:11:43,630 --> 00:11:46,530
Do you want to bite my neck?

99
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:50,430
What? We shouldn't do that!

100
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:00,870
I trust you.

101
00:12:33,670 --> 00:12:35,900
Are you okay, Sooha?

102
00:12:36,230 --> 00:12:39,580
Yeah. You barely put your mouth on me.

103
00:12:40,630 --> 00:12:41,770
What about you?

104
00:12:42,420 --> 00:12:44,760
You seem strained.

105
00:12:46,780 --> 00:12:49,500
Did you want to drink my blood?

106
00:12:50,020 --> 00:12:54,230
I'd be lying if I said 
I didn't feel the impulse.

107
00:12:55,220 --> 00:12:59,380
But not losing your 
trust is more important.

108
00:13:00,910 --> 00:13:02,680
I don't want to disappoint you.

109
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:06,310
You trusted me after learning what I am.

110
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:07,970
I don't want to betray you.

111
00:13:09,830 --> 00:13:11,660
I'm not disappointed.

112
00:13:13,720 --> 00:13:17,180
You've never betrayed me.

113
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:24,020
Until now, I've hated 
vampires more than anything.

114
00:13:24,020 --> 00:13:26,630
I thought they were dangerous 
monsters who attacked people.

115
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:32,660
But you always came to my 
rescue when I was in danger.

116
00:13:33,250 --> 00:13:34,870
That made me really happy.

117
00:13:36,670 --> 00:13:40,540
Knowing you're a vampire 
won't make me hate you.

118
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:44,400
I'm sorry for saying those 
awful things earlier.

119
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:47,930
You haven't changed 
since the moment we met.

120
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:51,730
I'm glad we got to know each other more.

121
00:13:52,070 --> 00:13:54,670
I hope you'll always be my friend.

122
00:14:05,130 --> 00:14:06,210
Thank you.

123
00:14:07,090 --> 00:14:07,820
<i>Heli!</i>

124
00:14:08,760 --> 00:14:11,070
<i>Jakah? Is that you, Jakah?</i>

125
00:14:11,070 --> 00:14:15,630
<i>Yeah. That guy vanished. 
Is Sooha all right?</i>

126
00:14:15,630 --> 00:14:17,580
<i>Yeah. How about you guys?</i>

127
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:21,050
<i>Some minor injuries, but everyone's fine.</i>

128
00:14:21,050 --> 00:14:22,130
<i>I see.</i>

129
00:14:22,650 --> 00:14:24,420
<i>Should we come to you?</i>

130
00:14:24,420 --> 00:14:28,510
<i>Oh... but Sooha wouldn't like that.</i>

131
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:31,950
Heli, tell him we'll go to them.

132
00:14:33,690 --> 00:14:34,670
Sooha!

133
00:14:34,670 --> 00:14:35,650
Khan!

134
00:14:37,290 --> 00:14:38,600
You're okay?

135
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,620
Yeah, thanks.

136
00:14:40,620 --> 00:14:43,190
It's because you came to save me.

137
00:14:43,190 --> 00:14:44,480
Are you okay?

138
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:46,400
Yeah, don't worry.

139
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,630
We're tough.

140
00:14:49,950 --> 00:14:51,320
Oh, good.

141
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:53,880
Thanks for the help earlier.

142
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:54,740
Huh?

143
00:14:54,740 --> 00:14:56,510
You don't need to thank us.

144
00:14:57,380 --> 00:15:01,170
We couldn't ignore the situation, either.

145
00:15:01,170 --> 00:15:02,080
Yeah.

146
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:05,150
Sooha, you probably saw earlier...

147
00:15:06,740 --> 00:15:09,340
but we're actually werewolves.

148
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:13,720
Really?

149
00:15:14,070 --> 00:15:14,950
Yeah.

150
00:15:15,350 --> 00:15:17,670
You saw us back there, right?

151
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:19,620
Sorry for scaring you.

152
00:15:22,910 --> 00:15:26,540
Everyone fears and avoids those 
who are different from them.

153
00:15:27,420 --> 00:15:30,650
We thought you'd hate us if you found out.

154
00:15:32,110 --> 00:15:36,110
But we couldn't afford to 
think about that back there.

155
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:39,750
We wanted to save you no matter what.

156
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:44,630
Khan, you guys...

157
00:15:44,630 --> 00:15:46,620
Thank you for saving me.

158
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:55,650
When I saw Sooha get knocked down, 
I felt a rage I'd never felt before.

159
00:15:56,370 --> 00:16:00,890
Before I knew it, I'd turned into a wolf
 and was charging toward him.

160
00:16:02,930 --> 00:16:09,890
I've been meaning to tell you guys, 
but I don't even know what I am.

161
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:12,130
You're Solon.

162
00:16:12,130 --> 00:16:17,030
It was surprising, but it 
doesn't change anything.

163
00:16:18,090 --> 00:16:19,450
Exactly.

164
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:21,960
Yeah.

165
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:24,510
Well said, Jino.

166
00:16:24,510 --> 00:16:25,960
Wait a minute.

167
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:29,960
Haven't we badmouthed werewolves a ton?

168
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:35,360
I did, too.

169
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:39,090
Aren't you really strong 
when you turn into a wolf?

170
00:16:39,090 --> 00:16:40,640
Oh, uh...

171
00:16:40,640 --> 00:16:42,340
What else changes?

172
00:16:42,340 --> 00:16:44,300
Your body temperature rises, right?

173
00:16:44,300 --> 00:16:45,570
Who's faster, you or Jakah?

174
00:16:45,570 --> 00:16:48,530
I've actually always wanted 
to ride on a wolf's back!

175
00:16:48,530 --> 00:16:49,180
Me, too!

176
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:49,650
Me, too.

177
00:16:49,650 --> 00:16:50,360
And me!

178
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:52,090
Right?

179
00:16:52,090 --> 00:16:53,910
Who wouldn't?

180
00:16:52,430 --> 00:16:54,450
I'm definitely faster!

181
00:16:53,910 --> 00:16:55,620
What are you, children?

182
00:16:54,450 --> 00:16:56,870
Should we see who's faster?

183
00:17:00,810 --> 00:17:02,750
Sooha! Heli!

184
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:14,050
Jakah.

185
00:17:14,050 --> 00:17:15,050
Jaan.

186
00:17:15,050 --> 00:17:16,050
Shion.

187
00:17:16,050 --> 00:17:17,180
Noa.

188
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:18,180
Jino.

189
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:19,750
And Solon.

190
00:17:20,740 --> 00:17:23,060
Thank you all so much.

191
00:17:25,060 --> 00:17:26,310
Solon.

192
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:36,450
I'm sorry you had to reveal 
your secret because of me.

193
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:39,420
I-It had nothing to do with you.

194
00:17:39,420 --> 00:17:41,790
That guy just pissed me off.

195
00:17:41,790 --> 00:17:46,710
I know, but I wanted 
to say it nonetheless.

196
00:17:47,110 --> 00:17:49,830
I'm sorry. And thank you.

197
00:17:54,210 --> 00:17:56,710
There's something I want to tell you guys.

198
00:17:57,220 --> 00:18:01,930
I don't hate you even if you're vampires.

199
00:18:01,930 --> 00:18:06,870
I don't think you're different 
from me even if you're werewolves.

200
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:19,510
I've hidden my unusual power until now,
 but you accepted me the way I am.

201
00:18:19,910 --> 00:18:21,870
That made me really happy.

202
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:26,120
So now, will you let me
 do the same for you?

203
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:27,530
Of course.

204
00:18:27,530 --> 00:18:28,370
Yeah.

205
00:18:28,370 --> 00:18:29,750
We'd love to be friends.

206
00:18:29,750 --> 00:18:32,380
Heck, let's become even better friends!

207
00:18:32,910 --> 00:18:33,880
Yeah.

208
00:18:36,430 --> 00:18:38,930
Enzy told me about you.

209
00:18:38,930 --> 00:18:41,510
You should've told us sooner.

210
00:18:44,190 --> 00:18:47,790
Man, Solon can be so weirdly stubborn!

211
00:18:47,790 --> 00:18:49,070
Shut up.

212
00:18:53,380 --> 00:18:56,150
I just can't figure it out.

213
00:18:56,150 --> 00:19:02,160
Why did he look like my 
childhood friend Chris?

214
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:05,240
You mean he's actually someone else?

215
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:07,700
Then who was that vampire?

216
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:09,490
We don't know yet,

217
00:19:09,490 --> 00:19:13,700
but he's on another level from 
the vampires we've faced until now.

218
00:19:13,700 --> 00:19:18,020
Come to think of it, he said something 
odd before he disappeared.

219
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:19,070
Something odd?

220
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,300
Yeah.

221
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:25,090
You really don't know anything, do you?

222
00:19:27,870 --> 00:19:29,180
What does that mean?

223
00:19:29,180 --> 00:19:33,710
He also said, "Do you want 
to meet the same fate again?"

224
00:19:35,110 --> 00:19:39,460
It almost sounded like 
he'd fought us before.

225
00:19:39,460 --> 00:19:41,590
Maybe he knows you guys.

226
00:19:50,570 --> 00:19:55,960
To tell you the truth, 
our friends keep going missing.

227
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,210
What?

228
00:19:57,620 --> 00:20:00,930
Werewolves have always 
been targeted by vampires.

229
00:20:01,370 --> 00:20:03,790
It's gotten worse lately.

230
00:20:04,530 --> 00:20:06,940
Our brothers are looking into it,

231
00:20:06,940 --> 00:20:09,840
but they haven't found any 
useful information yet.

232
00:20:09,840 --> 00:20:13,520
And yesterday, we lost contact with them.

233
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:18,020
The girl from our school 
who was attacked...

234
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:20,740
She was a werewolf, too.

235
00:20:21,130 --> 00:20:23,240
The culprit hasn't been caught yet?

236
00:20:25,690 --> 00:20:30,520
We assumed the victim was attacked by 
a vampire because she was a werewolf.

237
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:33,540
But maybe we were wrong.

238
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:36,290
She looked just like Sooha.

239
00:20:37,790 --> 00:20:41,610
So their actual target was Sooha?

240
00:20:41,610 --> 00:20:44,800
The guy who attacked 
today is the murderer?

241
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:47,120
It's possible.

242
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:50,570
Considering what happened today, 
you should be careful, Sooha.

243
00:20:52,560 --> 00:20:54,810
I don't know if that 
vampire targeting Sooha

244
00:20:54,810 --> 00:20:58,560
has anything to do with our 
friends' disappearances,

245
00:20:59,050 --> 00:21:00,610
but we'd all better be on guard.

246
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:02,030
Yeah.

247
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:08,210
Solon.

248
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:13,980
Thank you. You're the reason Sooha's safe.

249
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:17,750
No, I couldn't have done it alone.

250
00:21:17,750 --> 00:21:20,840
But hearing you say that is, uh...

251
00:21:23,310 --> 00:21:24,130
Sorry.

252
00:21:24,970 --> 00:21:30,350
It must've been hard having 
to keep that secret.

253
00:21:33,730 --> 00:21:36,520
Telling everyone was 
no big deal after all.

254
00:21:36,520 --> 00:21:38,700
They all laughed it off.

255
00:21:39,730 --> 00:21:40,980
Man, that's rude.

256
00:21:40,980 --> 00:21:42,010
Right?

257
00:21:42,010 --> 00:21:43,400
Sounds like them, though.

258
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:44,110
Yeah, I guess.

259
00:23:34,350 --> 00:23:39,930
<i>Next time, Episode 8: 
"Old Moon: Vampire Lord."</i>

260
00:23:36,970 --> 00:23:40,250
- Vampire Lord -

